# Local-only DPU device root CA certificates (.pem/.cer/.der). This directory is
# mounted into the localdev API image by dev/deployment/localdev/Dockerfile.api.localdev
# so carbide-api can seed the device trust store on startup. Never commit real CA
# material; only this .gitignore is tracked, so the directory exists for the COPY
# step and the build works (seeding is a no-op) when no certs are present locally.
*
!.gitignore
